resources.string:
SAI Pen needs the folder that holds SAI (sai2.exe). It can find it for you:

• it looks only at the names of folders and files in the tablet's shared storage (Downloads, Documents and the like), up to four folders deep;
• it looks for sai2.exe and for SAI's zip, nothing else;
• it does not open, copy or change your other files, and sends nothing anywhere;
• the folder it finds is remembered, so it does not search again.

Or choose the folder yourself.
